su name addition be map def
  su name function name ob text "u16 addition" ya
  su name slots ob ve text left right sum ya
  su name input slots ob ve text left right ya
  su name output slot ob name sum ya
  su name instruction series ob name addition instructions ya
  su name training case series ob name addition training ya
  su name heldout case series ob name addition heldout ya
prah

